# Exercise Standards

## File Organization
- Location: /exercices/enonces/
- Solutions: /exercices/solutions/
- Naming: ex_Chapitre X.[Chapter_Name].md

## Infrastructure Usage
- Domain: maxtec.be
- Primary DC: dns1.maxtec.be
- Workstations: ws-[dept]-[##].maxtec.be
- Network: 192.168.0.x range only

## Creation Rules
- Simple and practical initially
- Based on real situations
- Use previous chapter concepts
- GUI-based (no PowerShell)
- Need permission before creation

## Solution Guidelines
- Create only when requested
- Use GUI command sequences
- Simple, clear instructions
- Markdown format with <details>
- Need approval before creating

## Content Structure
- Add to existing files
- Don't modify without permission
- Follow chapter progression
- Use French for all content except:
  * Technical terms
  * Commands
  * DNS records
